# This file lists the NAMES of secrets the project needs.
# Never put real values in this file. It is committed to Git.
#
# For local development, copy the names into a file called .dev.vars
# (ignored by Git) and add real values there.
# In production, secrets are stored in Cloudflare's secret store.
#
# We will add names here as each feature needs them.

# Settings the Worker reads. Real values go in .dev.vars locally, or in Cloudflare for production.
# APP_ENV=development            (local only: prints sign-in links in the terminal)
# APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787  (the site's address; production value is in wrangler.toml)
# RESEND_API_KEY=                (production secret, set in Cloudflare)
# EMAIL_FROM=ph.ink <login@ph.ink>